WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Select the editable stroke and change its color.

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:03.700
Drag the partial eraser across the stroke to split it.

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.000
Two editable fragments remain.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:04.300
Undo restores the edited stroke.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.700
A synthetic barrel gesture orbits the restored stroke.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.000
The replay uses synthetic input with no pressure data.
